; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-058", "score": 0.119, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-058 | Study family SF-APPA-058: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- observed_research_question: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: Each star's top sequential suppressor is stable across seasons, and some teammate X->Y sequences have large negative premiums.\n- observed_result: 2/30 (7%) stable (>=75% same top suppressor): D. Mitchell PUTBACK 75%, L. James POST_UP 75%. Negative: J. Tatum->K. Porzingis DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.444 n=31; Giannis->Lillard DRIVE->PNR -0.263 n=31; J. Brown->J. Tatum SPOT_U [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Only 2/30 stars meet the 75% same-top-suppressor stability rule.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars x 4 seasons; min n=20/cell\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: null"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-058", "score": 0.107, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-058 | Study family SF-APPS-058: Observed on-ball defensive scheme labels (ORL-DET G1)\n- observed_research_question: Observed on-ball defensive scheme labels (ORL-DET G1)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: NBA matchup/PBP fields can label on-ball coverage (DROP/ICE/SWITCH) at usable rates.\n- observed_result: DET: 67 on-ball HC poss, 10 labeled (14.9%) ? DROP n=5 PPP=1.20, ICE_CANDIDATE n=5 PPP=0.80, OTHER n=57 PPP=1.42. ORL: 60 poss, 2 labeled (3.3%). switches_on unpopulated.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Confident label rates 14.9% and 3.3%; NBA matchups feed did not populate switches_on.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=67/60 possessions, 10/2 labeled\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: failed_gate"}], "n_results": 4}

